Z||000000||tgowens||08-03-2000||12:15 AM||||Once again, thank you for providing a forum where many many Fiero owners can join together and discuss the wonderous Fiero. Through this forum I have met so many wonderful people, either on here, through email and lastly, at the 16th Annual Fiero Festival in Louisville this past weekend. Many of the Forum members were identifiable by their display of your banner logo.<P>I met 2M4 Dale, Phil, Old Lar, Philpine, ChadMan, 87ECO5, Fiero56, Boilermaker, PAUL88GT, WilliamThornIII, and several others who are all the finest people I have met.<P>Thank you again for providing the forum to allow us to meet people we may otherwise never have met!<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.tgowens.com/MY_SIGNATURE.gif">               <BR><A HREF="http://www.tgowens.com/fiero" TARGET=_blank>www.tgowens.com/fiero</A>||||reg||1
